with-alignment. For search, you can only show the needle and haystack and say not found.\n\nShould I ask a clarifying question? She asked abstract; answer. Maybe end with offering to map onto her check tool when ready. But plan mode—no edits. Just answer.\n\nLet me be careful not to overstate. Also note that reporting both can be enormous — the practice is truncation/diff.\n\nLet me write in Russian, with categories and confidence. Keep reasonably tight but informative. Given the CLI style constraint says <4 lines unless detail asked — but she explicitly asked a conceptual \"best practice\" question, which implies detail is welcome. I'll be moderately detailed but not bloated.",
