at layer 25; it's a project-wide data+source migration.\n\nAlso: the \"какая-то пустота, это то же самое как битые символы или нет?\" — she had an unresolved sub-question. I can address briefly: the emptiness = the non-ASCII bytes were dropped/replaced because the sink decoded as UTF-8 and the CP1251 bytes are invalid; functionally \"same class as mojibake\" (lossy), just rendered as blank instead of visible replacement. [ПРЕДПОЛОЖЕНИЕ, СРЕДНИЙ].\n\nLet me finalize. Keep it structured and not too long.\n\nI'll write in Russian.",
